    <h1>The Rebuild Sprint. <em>Two weeks, custom-coded, hand-off.</em></h1>
    <p>The Rebuild Sprint is for service-business owners who want a real custom-coded site, do not want to commit to a recurring plan in order to get one, and would rather not write a five-thousand-dollar deposit cheque to a traditional agency in exchange for a maintenance retainer they did not ask for. Two weeks, $4,500 flat, and the result is yours when it ships.</p>
